@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox
title Get the list of publications in my library.

actor "User" as User
participant ":MiteLovers" as System



    User -> System : I want a list of publications from my library

    activate System

    System -> User : Enter your username

    deactivate System

    User -> System: username

    activate System

    System --> User : return list of publications

    deactivate System



@enduml